aid: attestedmemory-net
name: Attested Memory
image: https://attestedmemory.net/attested-social.png
description: Attested Memory provides verifiable context for people, teams, and autonomous agents through a SaaS platform that stores durable
  knowledge with cryptographic identity, truth state, and provenance. It offers personal, team, and expert memory products, USDC‑settled transactions,
  escrow, metering, and proof capabilities, all federated via the KOVA hub and integrated with the open AIMarket ecosystem.
url: https://artifacts.apis.io/attestedmemory-net/apis.yml
